{
  "title": "EC2 Auto Scaling · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "수요와 서버 상태에 맞춰 EC2 인스턴스 수를 유지하고 조절합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Auto Scaling</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#guide-1\">그룹의 기본 설정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#guide-2\">수요에 맞춘 확장</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>16 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Auto Scaling</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2 Auto Scaling은 <strong>필요한 수의 EC2 인스턴스를 유지하고 부하에 맞춰 늘리거나 줄이는 기능</strong>입니다. 서버에 장애가 나면 교체하고, 요청이 증가하면 같은 환경의 서버를 추가할 수 있습니다.</p><p>어떤 서버를 만들지는 시작 템플릿에, 몇 대를 유지할지는 Auto Scaling 그룹에 설정합니다. 로드 밸런서와 함께 사용하면 새 서버로 요청을 분산할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"launch-template\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"health-checks-and-replacement\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"target-tracking-scaling\"></span><h2>그룹의 기본 설정</h2><p><strong>최소·희망·최대 용량</strong>을 정합니다. 희망 용량은 현재 유지하려는 수이고 최소와 최대는 조절 가능한 범위를 정합니다. 시작 템플릿에는 AMI, 인스턴스 유형, 보안 그룹 등의 구성을 넣습니다.</p><p>여러 AZ의 서브넷을 지정하면 서버를 분산 배치할 수 있습니다. 상태 확인에서 비정상으로 판정된 서버는 새 서버로 교체하며, 로드 밸런서의 상태 확인을 사용하려면 연동 설정을 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"step-and-simple-scaling\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"mixed-instances-and-spot\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\"></span><h2>수요에 맞춘 확장</h2><p><strong>목표 추적 정책</strong>은 CPU 사용률 같은 지표를 목표 수준으로 유지하도록 용량을 조절합니다. 정해진 시간에 부하가 증가한다면 예약 확장도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>새 서버가 준비되는 워밍업<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 시간을 고려하고, 사용자 세션이나 업로드 파일은 서버 밖의 저장소에 두어 교체와 축소에 대응합니다. 이미지 변경은 인스턴스 새로 고침 기능으로 순차 배포할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>수요 변화에 대응하는 과정</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>지표 관찰</strong><span>요청량·CPU 등</span></li><li><strong>용량 조절</strong><span>설정한 범위에서 증감</span></li><li><strong>새 서버 준비</strong><span>상태 확인 후 요청 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">확장에는 시작 시간이 필요하므로 미리 확보할 용량과 확장 기준을 함께 정합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>행사 시간에 방문자가 몰리는 쇼핑몰은 최소 서버 수를 유지하면서 CPU 목표 추적 정책을 적용합니다. 시작 시간이 길면 행사 전에 예약 확장으로 서버를 준비합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>워밍업</strong> — 새 인스턴스가 시작한 뒤 애플리케이션과 지표가 안정될 때까지의 준비 시간입니다. 확장 판단과 트래픽 수용 시점에 영향을 줍니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/what-is-amazon-ec2-auto-scaling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q031\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1,2\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q084\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q098\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q002\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q032\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">다음 용어 <b>EC2 Purchasing Options</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
